  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[E6]One by one\n[E7]the stars appear\n[E6]The light of the day is\n[E7]no longer here.\n\n[Intrelude]\n[G#m]\n[F#/C#]  [D#/C#]\n[G#m]\n[F#/C#]  [D#/C#]\n[G#m]\n[F#/C#]  [D#/C#]\n[Am7]  [D]\n[Gm]  [Cm]  [D]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E6]One by one the\n[E7]stars disappear\n[E6]The sky grows brighter every\n[E7]minute of the sunrise\n\n[Chorus]\n[G#]Wake the world with a\n[C#]brand new [D#]morning\n[G#]Say hello to a-\n[C#]nother fine [D#]morning\n[G#]Got my face in the\n[C#]running [D#]water\n[Am7]Making my life [D]\n[G]so much [C]brigh - [D]ter\n\n[Verse 3]\n[E6]Moon shines bright, a-\n[E7]sleep in my bed Like\n[E6]so many people got a\n[E7]big day ahead of me\n\n[Chorus]\n[G#]Wake the world with a\n[C#]brand new [D#]morning\n[G#]Say hello to a-\n[C#]nother fine [D#]morning\n[G#]Wouldn't miss it for\n[C#]all of it's [D#]glory\n[Am7]I'll be there [D]\n[G]when you're [C]calling [D]me\n\n[Outro]\n[E6]One by one\n[E7]the stars appear\n[E6]The light of the day is\n[E7]no longer here.",
